msgid "I don't know what would've happened to me if I hadn't met you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Your loans haven't gone away, you know. You'll still need to work hard to "
"pay them back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I know! I will! I won't rest until I've paid off every last yen of my debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"I'd like to give you something to show my gratitude, but this is all I have,"
" I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>uno Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"You've done so much for me. I'm so glad our fates were intertwined. Thank "
"you, again!"
msgstr ""

